    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Associated skill 5 ranks, Study sphere.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 minute in deep concentration, spending 1 use of skill leverage to retry any failed Knowledge or Lore check at a +5 bonus. This bonus increases to +10 if you have unlocked skill leverage with the skill. You can only retry a skill check once using this talent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/study#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
